# Debugging this engine

Read `debug-notes.md` before diagnosing GC, parse, math, or correctness issues.

- **Current phase (2026-09-14 night): static analysis vs C.** Runtime probing (C-diff, ReleaseSafe, Octane, zigonly, oracle, Debug `bytecode.sh`, post-fix-25 sweep) is saturated as discovery. See "Next phase: static analysis vs C". **Probe before every engine edit:** write a minimal JS file, run C `../mquickjs/mqjs --memory-limit 16M` and Zig `./zig-out/bin/mqjs --memory-limit 16M`, show the outputs **differ** (or Zig panics). Matching output is not a Zig-only bug — log and continue. False "fix 29" (reverted): Zig unlabeled `break` in a switch-in-while already exits the loop; C `break` only leaves the switch. Last compared: … + convert_pos / jsSinCos+asin / floor wrappers / js_acos+atan+pow+round_inf / array join+reduce+sort / trim+toLowerCase / typed_array_set / global_eval / parser if+for+while / ToPrimitive+ToString+ToNumber / get_object_class / coerce eq+add / js_rem_pio2+kernelSin / Get+SetProperty typed-array / Date ctor / regexp flags / HasProperty / OP_throw+catch+gosub / lre_exec / js_atod internals / js_dtoa output+helpers / get+put loc+arg+var_ref / function proto+toString / number toString+toFixed / object toString / math atan2+pow+random / js_tan / typed_array ctor / parser break+labels / mpb_shr_round / JS_ToInt32Internal / JSON stringify / js_atan2 / OP_get_field+put_field / parser JSON / GetProperty string+char / Date valueOf / typeof+unary / js_pow libm / skip_spaces / OP add+sub+mul+div+mod / js_not_slow / kernelExp / next_token+ident / js_skip_parens / get_special_prop / SetProperty leftover / js_add_slow / OP arguments+fclosure+call+array_from / js_compact_props / js_json_parse / generic_return+return_call / js_parse_program+local_functions / JS_NewDate / compute_stack_size / add_var / js_load / JS_Parse2 / js_print / emit leftover / JS_NewObject* / js_parse_statement leftover / JS_MakeUniqueString / get_mblock_size+gc_mark+compact / JS_NewContext2 / stdlib_init / JS_PrepareBytecode / js_malloc / JS_DumpMemory / eval_file / JS_ToString leftover / reloc_c_func_name / JS_Throw leftover / mqjs main leftover / JS_NewStringLen / JS_ToCStringLen / parseInt+toExponential / Get+SetPropertyUint32 / js_parse_call / JS_LoadBytecode / js_function_constructor / string_buffer leftover / JS_SetPropertyStr / intern leftover / js_parse_expect / JS_SetOpaque / js_emit_push_number+delete / JS_ConcatString / JS_NewFloat64 / js_error_constructor / JS_Eval (no new mismatch). Next: remaining js_error_toString leftover; JS_DefinePropertyGetSet; leftover of define_field callers. hypot/cbrt/hyperbolic are not in this engine. Direct eval parse is a documented deviation. C `JS_CFUNC_f_f` throw-to-NaN is a C bug; Zig throws (oracle 09). C OP_get_length leftover `val` for STRING_CHAR is C-shared.
- Octane is **resolved**, clean through fix 28 on ReleaseFast (user-confirmed 2026-09-15; also ReleaseSafe through 24). Zig is slower than C — leave performance for last.
- **Legacy discovery (saturated):** `./tests/difftest/run.sh` (C reference at `../mquickjs/mqjs`). Still the ReleaseFast regression gate.
- Debug **compiles**; 16M `run.sh` ALL MATCH; `bytecode.sh` ALL MATCH (padding notes only). `setjmp` must stay a direct libc extern from `JS_Parse2` (do not wrap). Debug Octane is optional/slow — ask first.
- `./tests/zigonly/run.sh` covers default args (fix 21), let/const-as-var, and global eval. `run-safe.sh` includes it.
- `./tests/oracle/run.sh` is the no-C correctness suite (JSON/gc, default-arg+gc, math identities, fixes 22–26, `09_math_ff_throw`). `run-safe.sh` includes it. C `JS_CFUNC_f_f` throw-to-NaN is a C bug — do not copy it.
- ReleaseSafe/Debug `-o` padding-byte notes vs C are **expected**; Fast may be exact. Size diffs are bugs.
- Compare only against `../mquickjs` (C). Do not search other workspace dirs.
- Build `-Doptimize=ReleaseFast` for shipping; `-Doptimize=ReleaseSafe` for UB checks (`./tests/difftest/run-safe.sh`). Do not revert `valueToPtr`'s `@setRuntimeSafety`.
- C `JS_POP_VALUE` assigns the GC-updated pointer back. Never discard `popValue` when the local is used after a GC-capable call.
- Do not revert fixes 1–26 or 28. Do not re-apply compact-by-len, MakeUniqueString post-resize extras, global resize memcpy changes, or `JS_CFUNC_f_f` unconditional `JS_NewFloat64` (C dead store).
- `eval` global scope and `let`/`const` as `var` are **documented deviations** — not bugs.
- `mqjs tests/octane/run.js <suite>` argv SEGV is **fixed** (fix 18). Prefer `tests/difftest/` for discovery and `zig build octane` as the regression gate.
